  "description": "Experience increased comfort, traction and confidence over any rough terrain with our top-of-the-line HT7 hardtail model featuring a RockShox Reba 27.5in Plus fork and Sram GX 1x11 components. Single sprocket, no front derailleur and shifter means reduced weight and improved performance while still benefitting from a large choice of gears with its 30x11-42T ratio.\n6061-T6 Series alloy Hardtail frame, 27.5\" Plus geometry, Tapered 1.5\" head tube, 12x148mm Boost Thru-Axle\nRockShox Reba TK 27.5in Plus, 120mm Travel, 1-1/8-1.5in Taper steerer, Boost 15x110mm Thru-Axle, Maxle Stealth\nSram GX 1000 X-SYNC 30T crankset\nSram GX 1x11-speed rear derailleur & shifter\nSram XG 1150 10-42T cassette\nRitchey MTN Trail handlebar\nWTB Scraper 27.5\" Plus, 50mm width, alloy double wall rims w/ TCS i45 rim tape, Tubeless ready\nWTB Bridger Comp tires, 27.5*3.0\" Dual DNA, TCS, Aramid Bead 60 tpi\nShimano BR-M395 Hydraulic disc brakes",
